# Agent A (branding and shell) -- the project.godot change for the lead.
#
# Four things, all in [application]:
#
#   1. run/main_scene -> the splash. It starts a threaded load of main.tscn,
#      holds the logo 1.2 s (any tap skips), and hands over under the cream
#      curtain by 2.6 s at the latest. Every test still loads main.tscn by path.
#   2. config/icon -> the real app icon (512 px PNG cut from the approved
#      render). game/icon.svg is the old milk-bottle and is no longer
#      referenced once this lands; it can be deleted in a later pass.
#   3. boot_splash/image -> assets/branding/bootSplash.png (2048x1536, opaque,
#      597 KB), shown fullsize with filtering. The engine letterboxes it
#      against bg_color, which is the SAME cream as the image, so a 16:9 phone
#      sees no seam. show_image was explicitly false; it goes back to true.
#   4. bg_color unchanged (Palette.CREAM, #FFF6E5). Listed so the intent is
#      visible: the boot image, the splash scene and the curtain all share it.
#
# Verified live on macOS with the splash as the current scene: Splash at 19 ms,
# curtain up at 1.2 s, Main current at ~1.67 s, curtain lifted by ~2.0 s.
# Suite: PASS - 131 case(s) on wt2/brand with these keys applied locally.

--- a/game/project.godot
+++ b/game/project.godot
@@ [application]
 config/name="Little Days"
-run/main_scene="res://scenes/main/main.tscn"
+run/main_scene="res://scenes/splash/splash.tscn"
 config/features=PackedStringArray("4.7", "Mobile")
-config/icon="res://icon.svg"
+config/icon="res://assets/icon/app_icon_512.png"
+boot_splash/image="res://assets/branding/bootSplash.png"
+boot_splash/show_image=true
+boot_splash/fullsize=true
+boot_splash/use_filter=true
 boot_splash/bg_color=Color(1, 0.964706, 0.878431, 1)
-boot_splash/show_image=false
